.SS "xcb_connection_t * bernese::X11Info::GetConnection ()\fR [static]\fP"

.PP
Access the XCB connection we already have\&. 
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Must be called on the Qt GUI thread\&. The display connection will keep alive till Qt shuts down\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBWarning\fP
.RS 4
Don't shut down the connection manually!! 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
